EGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":2100330,"initDialog":210033001,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[2429],"performCfg":"","priority":10,"questId":21003,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":210033001,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":873740077,"text":"I can't cope...","nextNodeIds":[210033002]},{"nodeId":210033002,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3778252197,"text":"What's wrong?","nextNodeIds":[210033003]},{"nodeId":210033003,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":3693390773,"text":"Hmm? Who goes there? All who wish to cross this bridge are subject to interrogation, those are the rules.","nextNodeIds":[210033004]},{"nodeId":210033004,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":1654555093,"text":"That said... Just look at what you're wearing! You're definitely not someone I need to worry about...","nextNodeIds":[210033005]},{"nodeId":210033005,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":3169796837,"text":"Why? Think about it — criminals would want to dress as discreetly as possible, no? You, on the other hand, are dressed most ostentatiously indeed.","nextNodeIds":[210033015]},{"nodeId":210033015,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":3606823237,"text":"What are you doing here?","nextNodeIds":[210033006]},{"nodeId":210033006,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":1837532605,"text":"I am the Millelith responsible for this zone. This is a major thoroughfare to Dihua Marsh. Merchants and tourists all pass this way, so I'm stationed here to stand guard.","nextNodeIds":[210033007]},{"nodeId":210033007,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":3958450533,"text":"Just the other day, I discovered a group of monsters nearby... It appears they've set up a camp, and although they haven't made a move yet it's definitely a safety risk. I need to keep an eye on them.","nextNodeIds":[210033008]},{"nodeId":210033008,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":452943405,"text":"I'd happily go and clear them out... except, I worry that if I left my post here, some other monsters would seize the chance to ambush passers-by. I feel so helpless, stuck here all day...","nextNodeIds":[210033009]},{"nodeId":210033009,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":351336173,"text":"I dealt with the monsters.","nextNodeIds":[210033010]},{"nodeId":210033010,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":2922065077,"text":"Seriously? All of them? That's... fantastic!","nextNodeIds":[210033011]},{"nodeId":210033011,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":2793167429,"text":"This was a huge help. I am sorry I had to ask you — it should have been my job, but you ended up doing it all for me...","nextNodeIds":[210033012]},{"nodeId":210033012,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":2189389853,"text":"Ugh, I don't know what the higher-ups are thinking, they really should have sent some more people by now. This zone is far too big for only one person...","nextNodeIds":[210033013]},{"nodeId":210033013,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":1952340013,"text":"They will be getting a full report on this situation as soon as I have the opportunity.","nextNodeIds":[210033014]},{"nodeId":210033014,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2429,"speakerName":"Qiaoxi","textMapHash":2323534805,"text":"You have my thanks. Please take these for your trouble.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2100330,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLET